export anchor FlightStripsStyle:
    number: 135
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Flight strips
    idea: Projects are paper flight progress strips slotted into a grey bay, read left to right in tidy columns of callsign, route, progress boxes, due time and a status code.
    base: light
    palette:
        console: #e6ebe5, the page
        bay: #c9d1c9, strip bays and the side rack
        rail: #5d665f, bay headers, holder edges and borders
        ink: #1b2420, text, filled progress boxes, this week bars and the primary button
        muted: #4b5650, column keys and task counts
        buffStrip: #f5e7ae, Design and Research strips and last week bars
        blueStrip: #d4e5f4, Engineering strips
        pinkStrip: #f3d8de, Marketing strips
        normal: #1e6b3a, On track with a ring
        caution: #8a5100, At risk with a solid triangle
        alert: #a3191f, Behind with a barred square, overdue text
        focus: #0b57a8, the focus outline only
    type:
        Mono for data uses IBM Plex Mono, SF Mono, Menlo, Consolas,
        monospace. Sans for names and prose uses Helvetica Neue, Helvetica,
        Arial. Board digits 34px mono bold, greeting 28px sans bold,
        callsigns 18px mono bold, project names 16px sans bold, body 14px,
        keys 10px bold caps tracked 0.12em.
    layout:
        A 168px left side rack holds the brand in mono and nav as stacked
        strips with a 6px rail edge and a three letter code, the current
        one dark with a buff edge. A pale top bar holds a framed search, New
        project, a square bell and On position Mara Okafor. A status line
        has the mono date, the greeting and a red Attention line with a
        triangle, and on the right a boxed board of four mono numbers. The
        Active bay lists six strips under column keys, each strip a grid of
        callsign with category, name with task count, ten progress boxes
        with a percent, due date and status with a short code, sorted by
        due date and coloured by department. A right column has a Radio log
        of small strips and a Movements chart with outline bars for last
        week and solid bars for this week. Below 820px the rack becomes a
        top row and strips wrap into two rows.
    spacing: A 4px base. 6px between strips, 10px inside cells, 24px between bays.
    density: High. One strip per project about 58px tall, every fact in its own column.
    corners: Strips square, bays and buttons 2 to 3px.
    borders: A 10px rail holder edge on the left of each strip, 1px grey around, hairline column dividers.
    shadows: A hard 2px drop under each strip so it sits in the bay. Nothing else.
    icons: Ring for On track, solid triangle for At risk, solid square with a white bar for Behind, beside the word and codes NML, RISK, BHND.
    focus: A 3px blue outline offset 2px.
    tone: Terse controller speech, such as Active bay, Radio log, Movements and On position.
